---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy — Hermes Agent 101";
const description = "Privacy policy for Hermes Agent 101 covering site data, analytics providers, third-party links, retention expectations, and user rights.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en" canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <Nav lang="en" />
  <main class="pt-24 pb-20 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-8 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-sm max-w-none text-white/80 space-y-6">
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>Hermes Agent 101 (hermes101.dev) is an independent community guide site. It is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with Nous Research or the official Hermes Agent project. This policy explains what data we collect and how we handle it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">2. Analytics we use</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</strong> — page views, events, and conversion metrics. GA4 may set cookies and process IP addresses.</li>
          <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> — session recordings, heatmaps, and interaction patterns to improve UX.</li>
          <li><strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> — privacy-friendly, cookie-less traffic overview.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell or share analytics data with third parties for advertising purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">3. Data retention</h2>
        <p>Analytics data is retained according to each provider's default policies (typically 2–26 months). We do not maintain separate user databases or account systems.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">4. Third-party content</h2>
        <p>Some pages embed or link to external resources (e.g., official Hermes Agent documentation at hermes-agent.nousresearch.com, GitHub repositories). Those sites have their own privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions, reach out via the <a href="/faq/" class="text-[#51ffb4] underline">FAQ page</a> or the GitHub repository.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>
